 M('Teach and engage','Apply',5,['Questions that make learners think.','Groups and pairs.','Pace.'],'Think-pair-share.','Teach 15 minutes.','Peers note engagement.','What is think-pair-share?','Think alone, discuss with a partner, share.'),
